          <a href="https://github.com/qazybekb/openmind" target="_blank" class="block text-text-secondary hover:text-text-secondary transition-colors">GitHub</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/qazybekb/openmind/blob/main/docs/CONTRIBUTING.md" target="_blank" class="block text-text-secondary hover:text-text-secondary transition-colors">Contributing</a>
